<view class="walk-page {{careMode?'care-mode':''}}">
  <view class="top"><text class="heading">按自己的脚步规划</text><button bindtap="care">{{careMode?'标准字号':'大字模式'}}</button></view>
  <text class="note">先记预计，走完补实际。只记录同一位出门者，家人可以代填。</text>
  <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</text><text wx:if="{{status}}" class="status" role="status">{{status}}</text>
  <block wx:if="{{ready}}">
    <view class="summary"><text>当前日常步速 {{current}}</text><text class="heading">{{summary.ready?'建议试用 '+summary.medianMps+' 米/秒':'先积累几次相近路况的实走'}}</text><text>{{summary.reason}}</text><text wx:if="{{summary.ready}}">{{kilometer}}</text><text wx:if="{{summary.total > 0}}" class="note">有效{{summary.count}}次 / 全部{{summary.total}}次。步速范围只是已填记录的变化，不保证今后的用时。</text><button wx:if="{{summary.ready}}" class="primary" bindtap="apply">采用建议步速</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="section"><text class="heading">走完补记</text><block wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><block wx:if="{{item.id === pending}}"><text>{{item.label}} · {{item.source}}</text><text>{{item.prediction}}</text></block></block><text class="note">按秒表或自己的记录填写；本页不自动计时。等灯、休息和办事都算停留。</text><label>总用时（秒）<input type="number" value="{{elapsed}}" data-key="elapsed" bindinput="field"/></label><label>其中停留（秒）<input type="number" value="{{stopped}}" data-key="stopped" bindinput="field"/></label><button class="primary" bindtap="finish">保存这次实走</button></view>
    <view wx:else class="section"><text class="heading">准备下一次记录</text><text class="note">选已知长度、适合正常步行的路段，不用沿途操作手机。</text><label>路段简称<input value="{{form.label}}" maxlength="60" data-key="label" bindinput="field"/></label><label>已知距离（米）<input type="number" value="{{form.meters}}" data-key="meters" bindinput="field"/></label><label>距离来源<picker range="{{sources}}" value="{{sourceIndex}}" bindchange="source"><view class="picker">{{sources[sourceIndex]}}</view></picker></label><view class="check" bindtap="usual" role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{form.usual}}"><checkbox checked="{{form.usual}}"/><text>按平时步速走平路，没有刻意快走或明显负重</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="prepare">准备记录，固定预计用时</button><text class="note">只有已量距离、日常走法用于建议；地图估算与模拟练习单独保留。</text></view>
    <button bindtap="evidence">{{showEvidence?'收起':'查看'}}预测对照与记录（{{summary.total}}）</button>
    <view wx:if="{{showEvidence}}" class="section"><text class="heading">事先的预计，和后来实际的差别</text><text>{{evaluation}}</text><text class="note">两种预计比较同一批后续记录。误差为纯步行用时的绝对差；距离与用时由本人填报，未经独立现场核验。</text><button bindtap="copy" disabled="{{!rows.length}}">复制对照摘要</button><button wx:if="{{rows.length}}" bindtap="backup">复制完整记录备份</button><button wx:if="{{rows.length}}" bindtap="resetRecords">已备份，清空实走记录</button><label wx:if="{{rows.length}}">排除原因（需要排除时填写）<input value="{{exclusion}}" maxlength="120" data-key="exclusion" bindinput="field" placeholder="例如距离记错；原始记录仍保留"/></label><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><text class="heading">{{item.label}}</text><text class="note">{{item.source}} · {{item.date}}</text><text>{{item.prediction}}</text><text>{{item.observation}}</text><text>{{item.reason}}</text><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="exclude">{{item.excluded?'恢复这条记录':'排除这条记录'}}</button></view><text wx:if="{{!rows.length}}">还没有记录。准备第一条后可离开本页，走完再回来补记。</text></view>
  </block>
</view>
